  "text": "### FCA Escalation (Customer-Initiated)  \n**If Customer Unhappy:**\n- FirstUK Bank provides FCA contact information\n- Customer can escalate to Financial Ombudsman Service (FOS)\n- FOS is independent, free to customer\n- FOS decision is binding  \n**Escalation Letter Must Include:**\n- Statement of rights\n- FOS contact: 0800 023 4567, www.financialombudsman.org.uk\n- Time limit: Customer must escalate within 6 months of final response  \n---",
